UnitMetaquoter::QuoteExactInputSingleV3
├── when the pool factory is not approved
│   └── it reverts with AF
└── given the pool factory is approved
    ├── when the pool is not a registered target
    │   └── it reverts with IP
    └── given the pool is a registered target
        ├── when the pool type is not CL
        │   └── it reverts with PT
        └── given the pool type is CL
            ├── when tokenIn is not a pool token
            │   └── it reverts with TI
            └── given tokenIn is a pool token
                ├── given no price limit
                │   ├── when tokenIn is token0
                │   │   ├── it simulates the swap zeroForOne with the minimum price limit
                │   │   └── it returns the decoded quote and the initialized ticks crossed
                │   └── when tokenIn is token1
                │       ├── it simulates the swap oneForZero with the maximum price limit
                │       └── it returns the decoded quote and the initialized ticks crossed
                ├── given a price limit
                │   └── when the input swap is simulated
                │       └── it forwards the price limit to the pool
                ├── when the pool swap does not revert
                │   └── it reverts with NC
                ├── when the pool reverts with a reason string
                │   └── it bubbles the reason string
                ├── when the pool reverts with a payload shorter than an error string
                │   └── it reverts with Unexpected error
                ├── when the swap crosses initialized ticks
                │   └── it returns the number of initialized ticks crossed
                ├── when the swap starts on an initialized tick
                │   └── it excludes the starting tick from the count
                └── when a downward swap ends on an initialized tick
                    └── it excludes the ending tick from the count
